        <briefdescription>
<para>Single-character hint label from the filename itself. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The label is a character from the token&apos;s own name. First char is preferred; if already taken by another span, subsequent chars are tried until a unique one is found. <computeroutput><ref refid="structterminal_1_1_link_span_1a38c420d7a733ff7b7e40129d8b577df1" kindref="member">labelCol</ref></computeroutput> indicates which column the label character occupies. Null-terminated. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
